Final Digital Growth Campaign – Codomax Internship

1. Campaign Overview

The Final Digital Growth Campaign consolidates the digital marketing research, content planning, SEO activities, promotional creatives, competitor analysis, and conversion optimization recommendations prepared during the Codomax Digital Marketing Internship.

Company: Codomax Digital Solutions
Official Website: https://codomaxdigital.in/
Internship Page: https://codomaxdigital.in/internship
Campaign Duration: Modules 01–07

Main Objective

To develop a 360-degree digital growth strategy that can improve internship awareness, attract relevant student audiences, increase website traffic, and encourage internship registrations.

2. Target Audience

The campaign focuses on:

College students

Undergraduate and postgraduate students

Fresh graduates

MCA, BCA, BTech, and other technical students

Beginners looking for practical technology experience

Students interested in online internships and project-based learning

