12. Conclusion

This project provided practical exposure to several digital marketing activities, including SEO research, content planning, competitor analysis, social media campaign preparation, influencer research, and conversion rate optimization.

The final campaign combines these activities into a structured digital growth strategy for the Codomax internship page.

The research, documentation, and creative materials provide a foundation for future implementation. Actual campaign execution and performance tracking would be the next steps required to evaluate its impact on website traffic and student registrations.

